# NVIDIA-shipped Go binaries — container-toolkit v1.19.1 (nvidia-ctk,
# nvidia-container-runtime, hooks; built with Go 1.23.4) and Nsight
# Compute/Systems nic_sampler plugins (Go 1.26.3) — carry Go stdlib CVEs
# that only an NVIDIA rebuild can fix; re-baking installs the same latest
# stable packages and cannot clear them.
#
# Track: https://github.com/NVIDIA/nvidia-container-toolkit/releases
# (waiting on >= 1.20.0 stable). Delete these entries once NVIDIA ships a
# rebuilt toolkit/Nsight and force_bake — the packages are unpinned, so a
# fresh bake picks the fix up automatically.
#
# Every suppression auto-expires (the gate re-arms) on the exp: date below.
# Extend only with security-team sign-off.
